# Intentionally empty.
#
# This file exists so the build secret always has a source to mount: compose
# refuses to start when a declared secret's file is missing, and the common
# case is a public registry needing no credentials at all.
#
# To use an authenticated internal registry, copy deploy/npm/npmrc.example to
# deploy/npm/npmrc, put your credentials in it, and set in .env:
#
#   NPM_CONFIG_FILE=./deploy/npm/npmrc
